# This client-only build currently requires no runtime secrets or environment
# variables. Do not add API keys to VITE_* variables: Vite embeds those values
# in the public browser bundle.
#
# Do not add CLOUDFLARE_API_TOKEN or CLOUDFLARE_ACCOUNT_ID to a Pages project's
# build variables. Native Pages Git integration performs deployment itself and
# does not run Wrangler from this repository.
